// Title: impact_high_number_of_protected_branch_force_pushes_by_user.toml
// Source: detection-rules::rules/integrations/github/impact_high_number_of_protected_branch_force_pushes_by_user.toml
// Section: EQL Rule
// Rule Name: High Number of Protected Branch Force Pushes by User
// Author: Elastic
// Description:
// Detects a high number of force push actions to protected branches by a single user within a short
// time frame. Adversaries may perform force pushes to overwrite commit history on protected branches,
