// Title: discovery_win_network_connections.toml
// Source: detection-rules::rules_building_block/discovery_win_network_connections.toml
// Section: EQL Building Block
// Rule Name: Windows System Network Connections Discovery
// Author: Elastic
// Description:
// This rule identifies the execution of commands that can be used to enumerate network connections. Adversaries may
// attempt to get a listing of network connections to or from a compromised system to identify targets within an
